'''4th Anniversary Birthday Cake''' (4周年記念ケーキわんこ) is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in [[Anniversary|Birthday Present!]] It was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = 4th Anniversary Birthday Cake
|image = E 297.png
|appearance = [[Four Years of Fun!!|Birthday Present!]]
|money drop = 4¢ - 15¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy appears to be three [[Doge]]s carrying a small-size birthday cake that stands on a can of Cat Food. The Doges remain hidden under the can but can be seen during its attack animation. Although it may not look like one, it is actually a Metal enemy.

==Strategy==
[[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and any other fast attacking characters such as [[Mr. (Special Cat)|Mr.]] can kill this enemy very easily. It deals pretty much no damage per hit, so there's no need to worry about it at all.

==Encounters==
{{Collapsible}}
